    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7BPq27",
      "title": "Add missing chains to schema validation anyOf array",
      "author": "Zentex1337",
      "number": 1269,
      "body": "## Summary\n- Added 5 chains that were missing from the TOKEN_DATA_SCHEMA anyOf validation array:\n  - celo\n  - celo-sepolia\n  - swellchain\n  - ink\n  - ink-sepolia\n\nThese chains are defined in `chains.ts` and `types.ts` but were not included in the schema validation. This could cause validation to incorrectly reject tokens that only specify these chains as their deployment target.\n\n## Test plan\n- Cross-referenced with chains.ts and types.ts to verify all supported chains are now included\n- The schema dynamically generates properties from NETWORK_DATA, but the anyOf array requires manual maintenance",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
